2048
01:14:41,275 --> 01:14:45,655
[imp yells]
[Servo imitates Three Stooges]

2049
01:14:47,689 --> 01:14:49,172
Oh, God, imp batch.

2050
01:14:50,172 --> 01:14:52,034
Quickly, to the wood
where Smolkin hides.

2051
01:14:52,068 --> 01:14:55,413
And after her lady's
greatly choice.

2052
01:14:55,448 --> 01:14:57,965
Should we haul the imp
out to the curb, or...

2053
01:15:00,620 --> 01:15:01,620
[cat meows]

2054
