Flying veal cutlet, ew.

2055
01:15:06,896 --> 01:15:09,758
♪ Three blind mice

2056
01:15:09,793 --> 01:15:11,517
♪ Hickory, dickory dock

2057
01:15:11,551 --> 01:15:13,586
Oh, forget it, I've lost it.

2058
01:15:18,517 --> 01:15:19,689
Digger, come by us, honey,

2059
01:15:19,724 --> 01:15:20,689
