2061
01:15:27,413 --> 01:15:28,965
Leave me alone, you booger.

2062
01:15:29,000 --> 01:15:30,758
The world's quietest fight.

2063
01:15:34,517 --> 01:15:37,172
'Tis good Meg Maud,
the mother of the toads.

2064
01:15:37,206 --> 01:15:38,206
Well you have
one litter of toads,

2065
