Pray, keep him from me.
[cat meows]

2068
01:15:48,482 --> 01:15:49,655
Sam!

2069
01:15:50,931 --> 01:15:52,275
Ah, ooh, sorry, wrong spot.

2070
01:15:52,310 --> 01:15:53,620
Keep thy place, malignancy.

2071
