- Take the axe.
- Take the death!

2127
01:17:49,344 --> 01:17:50,379
- Life!
- Take the death!

2128
01:17:50,413 --> 01:17:51,551
- No, choose the curtain.
- And live.

2129
01:17:51,586 --> 01:17:53,172
- No, the sun runs out.
- Death, come on!

2130
01:17:53,206 --> 01:17:55,000
- Stay, Helene!
- Go.

2131
