Stay!
[group laughs]

2132
01:17:57,034 --> 01:17:58,724
Stop the movie!

2133
01:17:59,862 --> 01:18:01,862
Pass, next category.

2134
01:18:01,896 --> 01:18:03,689
Tear me no more.

2135
