From this madness I've
come to understand one thing.

2138
01:18:13,068 --> 01:18:14,551
This makes no sense.

2139
01:18:14,586 --> 01:18:17,103
If I die at my
appointed time this dawn,

2140
01:18:17,137 --> 01:18:18,379
Stay!

2141
