2164
01:19:10,551 --> 01:19:13,034
You'll notice there's
nothing up my jerkin.

2165
01:19:14,758 --> 01:19:16,827
Oh, he's got long nails, ugh.

2166
01:19:18,275 --> 01:19:19,448
And the body of...

2167
