I am Apolytus, give me life.

2168
01:19:24,586 --> 01:19:26,103
Only I don't know-it-us.

2169
01:19:26,137 --> 01:19:28,034
I am a mother, give me life.

2170
01:19:28,068 --> 01:19:30,034
I am a co-ed at a
small, midwestern college.

2171
01:19:30,068 --> 01:19:31,206
Give me life.

2172
