I'm Mayer Ed
Koch, how am I doing?

2173
01:19:33,551 --> 01:19:34,724
Give me life.

2174
01:19:34,758 --> 01:19:36,275
I'm Dan Murry,
welcome to Las Vegas.

2175
01:19:36,310 --> 01:19:37,724
I am Diana.

2176
01:19:37,758 --> 01:19:40,000
The wasted years of
my past are done.

2177
