2192
01:20:23,620 --> 01:20:25,068
That's the seven.

2193
01:20:27,620 --> 01:20:29,689
- Helene, wait!
- No, no, I'm not waiting.

2194
01:20:29,724 --> 01:20:30,655
No.

2195
